{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2021-04-08 02:00:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK REAL ASSETS ACHIEVES A US$4.8 BILLION FINAL CLOSE FOR GLOBAL RENEWABLE POWER FUND III', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BLACKROCK REAL ASSETS HAS SUCCESSFULLY ACHIEVED A US$4.8 BILLION FINAL CLOSE OF GLOBAL RENEWABLE POWER FUND III (“GRP III” OR THE “FUND”) WITH COMMITMENTS FROM OVER 100 INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS, INCLUDING LEADING PUBLIC AND PRIVATE PENSION FUNDS, INSURANCE COMPANIES, ENDOWMENTS, FOUNDATIONS AND FAMILY OFFICES FROM OVER 18 COUNTRIES GLOBALLY. GRP III IS THE THIRD VINTAGE OF BLACKROCK'S GLOBAL RENEWABLE POWER FUND SERIES AND THE FIFTH FUND OVERALL, WHICH INVESTS IN GLOBA"}